 **Data Structures:**
-*   **Camera Pose:** Represented as a $4 \times 4$ view matrix or separate rotation matrix and translation vector.
-*   **Loss Components:** Scalar values for Cross-Entropy ($L_{CE}$) and Normalized Mean Squared Error ($L_{MSE}$).
